<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Soccer-Ireland vs Wales live on Irish television.</title>
<headline>Soccer-Ireland vs Wales live on Irish television.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's friendly international against Wales in Cardiff on February 11 will be shown live on Irish national television, the Football Association of Ireland (FAI) said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The FAI said transmission from the Arms Park in Cardiff will begin at 1905 GMT and will end at 2100 GMT. The game is scheduled to kick-off at 1930 GMT.</p>
<p>--Dublin Newsroom 353-1-661-3377</p>
</text>
